---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Popup from "../components/Popup.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <Header />
  <!-- <main class="mt-30"> -->
  <section
    class="w-[95%] sm:w-[82%] md:w-[50%] m-auto h-auto p-4 mt-20 mb-10 text-justify"
  >
    <p>Hie, am Jabulani.</p>
    <br />
    <p>
      A self-taught code breaker, bug-creator and one of the best <mark
        ><i>"google searcher."</i></mark
      > (or so i believe).
    </p>
    <br />
    <p>
      Join me as I’m currently descending into the digital darkness. It’s going
      to be messy n I’ll prolly break several l*ws of &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;
      &nbsp; &nbsp; along the way. Honestly, Google already knows my passowrds
      and other stuff, so that’s all the info you’re getting from me.
    </p>
    <br />
    <p>
      Good luck navigating through the posts. If you ever get stack, just
      remember:
      <Popup
        id="glitch-gif"
        triggerText="The horse never made it to the airport because the life guard was busy in the parliament singing for the dogs."
      >
        <img
          src="https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExNjR6dTNtNWkzZG1rcjhweTh0Zmp0MWJrdGVzYnR5Zzk5MXFzcHVzciZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/6xUCD3r52TMoyIafYC/giphy.gif"
          class="w-full"
        />
      </Popup>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
